gametitle=Burnout Revenge (PS2) - Nuzlocke v2.0.4

[Nuzlocke\Block dead cars in garage]
author=Nuzlocke mod
description=Blocks wrecked cars in the garage and in crash junctions, locks events that can't be won any more (perfected ones on Hard), and signals every finished event to the tracker.
// --- Part 1: block dead cars (v7) ---
// The game's confirm check (002A64A8) is called from two places, both now go through the wrapper at
// 000FF000: 002ACE00 (normal Select) and 002A69DC (a Select remembered while the carousel was busy).
// Select is refused if the highlighted car (garage object + 0x1018 -> entry +0) or the car the
// carousel is heading to (carousel list[byte +0x181 of the controller]) is in the dead-car table.
// Dead-car table (written by the tracker): 000FF400 count (word), 000FF408 8-byte car labels. These are
// the cars wrecked in the Race pool; crash junctions use their own table at 000FF700 (part 3).
patch=1,EE,000FF000,word,27BDFFE0
