// --- Part 3: block dead cars in crash junctions (v9) ---
// The crash junction car select has its own Select handler (0018F508): it sets controller +0x1FA to
// start the junction. Its first two instructions now jump to a check at 000FF140 that returns at once
// (as if Select wasn't pressed) when the highlighted car (crash carousel 01C958A8 + player x 0xC90,
// current entry +0xC78) or the currently loaded car ([01C10C18] -> label) is in the Crash dead-car table
// (000FF700, written by the tracker; v10, separate from the garage's 000FF400 since the two life pools).
