// --- Part 4: the event unlock check (v2) ---
// The game's unlock check (00134568: the event's rank against yours, then the race and crash chains in
// that rank) goes through 000FF200 first (its first test, lbu v0,0x400(s0), becomes j 000FF200):
// - Event Roulette's pick (label at 000FE140, written by the tracker): only that event is unlocked.
// - The lock table at 000FE400 (8-byte labels, ending with 0, written by the tracker): those events are
//   locked. On Hard these are the events you've perfected, which can't be won any more.
// - Event Roulette on (marker 000FE138, or 00479FFC in a patched ISO): every other event is unlocked.
// - Otherwise the game's own check.
