[Nuzlocke\Harder AI\Medium]
author=Nuzlocke mod
description=Harder opponents, Medium level: faster and more aggressive. Enable only one Harder AI level. Corners at 0.9125 of the racing line's limit (0.9625 on aggressive stretches); far from the player, 3.5-6.5 s per section quicker than their pace schedule; catch-up from 25 m behind the player (up to +27 m/s); ease-off from 80 m ahead of the player (to 0.95 x the player's speed); speed cap 107 m/s. Opponents go for takedowns more often, from further away and sooner after the start, block you for longer and slam 30% harder. See docs/research/ai-catchup.md and ai-aggression.md.
// Corner speed factor (game: 0.8, aggressive 0.85)
patch=1,EE,0029EE1C,word,3C013F69
patch=1,EE,0029EE20,word,3421999A
patch=1,EE,0029EE30,word,3C013F76
patch=1,EE,0029EE34,word,34216666
// Far-mode pace: offset to each section's planned time, clamped to -6.5..-3.5 s (game: -4..+4)
