[Nuzlocke\Harder AI\Insane]
author=Nuzlocke mod
description=Harder opponents, Insane level: faster and more aggressive. Enable only one Harder AI level. WARNING: Insane is not meant to be fair; most runs will end within a few events. Corners at 0.975 of the racing line's limit (1 on aggressive stretches); far from the player, 6-9 s per section quicker than their pace schedule; catch-up from 10 m behind the player (up to +40 m/s); ease-off from 110 m ahead of the player (to 0.98 x the player's speed); speed cap 115 m/s. Opponents go for takedowns more often, from further away and sooner after the start, block you for longer and slam 100% harder, and every opponent attacks. See docs/research/ai-catchup.md and ai-aggression.md.
// Corner speed factor (game: 0.8, aggressive 0.85)
